## Install

Drop this directory into your Claude Code plugins marketplace, or reference it directly in your settings under `plugins`. The skills and commands become available as `/{{PLUGIN_SLUG}}:...`.

## Caveats

- This plugin was generated from a single video. Facts are as accurate as the video + any fetched documentation. Check `skills/*/references/sources.md` before relying on any specific command or configuration value in production.
- Any claim marked "the video did not show..." is an honest gap. Fill it in yourself before shipping.
- Scripts marked with transcription-confidence warnings in their source comments should be verified against official documentation before running.

## Regenerating

To re-run the skill-factory with different choices:

```
/bespoke-agentics:video-to-deliverables '{{VIDEO_SOURCE}}' '{{PROJECT_NAME}}' '{{LABEL}}' --profile skill-factory --from-deliverables {{DELIVERABLES_DIR}}
```

`--from-deliverables` skips the expensive extraction/analysis phases and re-runs only the interview and generation.
